      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... im feeling really weird. my chest feels like there is a heavy pressure right in the middle of it and my left arm feels kinda numb and tingly. i think i might just be having a really bad panic attack because work has been crazy lately but im a bit worried. what should i do?",
