      "content": "I understand you're feeling anxious, but it's important to address these physical symptoms. Try some deep breathing exercises, like inhaling slowly through your nose for 4 seconds, holding it for 7 seconds, and exhaling slowly through your mouth for 8 seconds. Remove yourself from any stressful situation if possible, and consider reaching out to a friend or family member for support. If your symptoms persist, please see a healthcare professional. Stay safe!",
      "source": "target",
