      "content": "the breathing helped a little but the pressure is still there. it feels more like a heavy weight than just butterflies in my stomach. and the arm thing isn't going away. do u think i should just go to bed and see if it feels better in the morning? i really dont want to go to the er if i can help it, it's just so expensive and honestly i'm probably just overthinking it because of this project at work.",
